<title>USA: Sport Supply says to sell golf division.</title>
<headline>Sport Supply says to sell golf division.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport Supply Group Inc said it agreed to sell the remaining assets of its discontinued golf-related operations to the division's management and certain outside investors.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to reduce the company's debt.  </p>
<p>The transaction contains no financing contingencies and is expected to close by March 31, subject to a possible extension to no later than April 30.</p>
</text>
